			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Add Matches pre-filter and borrow Parameters in CreateEffectForRequest\n\nIntroduce a `Matches(MethodName: &str) -> bool` predicate on every CreateEffectForRequest module so the central dispatcher can reject non-matching method names before invoking the full constructor. This eliminates unnecessary work and aligns with the ActionEffect dispatch pattern used elsewhere.\n\nChange `CreateEffect` signatures across all modules from `Parameters: Value` to `Parameters: &Value`, removing the unconditional `Parameters.clone()` call from the hot dispatch path and deferring cloning into the individual effect macro invocations only when needed.\n\nReorder the module chain in `Source/Track/Effect/CreateEffectForRequest/mod.rs` — moving `FileSystem`, `Commands`, `Terminal`, and `TreeView` into a new sequence — and wrap each `Try!` invocation with the `Matches` guard.",
			"SHA": "be9aaf5b1cc0156d3236573d11a617984e0da2ef"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-04T19:06:50Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1731,
				1
			],
			"Message": "fix(Mountain): Clean up ActiveOperations registry on RPC cancellation\n\nImmediately remove the cancelled operation from the ActiveOperations write lock after triggering its cancellation token, preventing a leaked CancellationToken per RPC that accumulated when operations did not reach their own UnregisterOperation call site.\n\nRemove the redundant client-side method name format check that rejected paths containing \"../\" or \"::\" separators from the request validation path.",
			"SHA": "28bf3528fd4eb3af543c2ef45b1a37c622cd6088"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-04T19:03:34Z",
			"File": [
