			],
			"Message": "Merge branch 'Current' of ssh://github.com/CodeEditorLand/Mountain into Current",
			"SHA": "8efe02eff66da4e11cf592aca92f3fe82ea1f394"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-04T19:03:27Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1731,
				1
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Update sidecar dispatching docs and parameter types\n\nReplace the TODO section with a FUTURE section in DispatchSideCarRequest, removing the obsolete implementation items (timeout handling, cancellation, metrics, auth) and replacing them with a note that SideCarIdentifier is retained for planned multi-sidecar routing.\n\nAlso narrow SideCarIdentifier from String to &str to avoid unnecessary ownership transfer, and update the dev_log category from \"ipc\" to \"grpc\" to reflect that this path matches the gRPC-based sidecar communication layer.",
			"SHA": "69b249e027cd897d7e053ebb1063a2a7d1b149d7"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-04T19:03:09Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1731,
				1
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Use lazy format args in dev_log macro\n\nReplace `format!($($Arg)*)` with `format!(\"{}\", format_args!($($Arg)*))` in `Source/IPC/DevLog/mod.rs`.\n\nDefers format-string construction to the outer `format!`, which is the standard pattern for lazily captured arguments in conditional debug-logging paths.",
			"SHA": "6d8a6822928251d730422554ba3879955855aa1c"
